<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB 1996 Q4 net falls 36 pct.</title>
<headline>ABB 1996 Q4 net falls 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the fourth quarter of 1996 compared with the same quarter in 1995 (October-December).</p>
<p>				   (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit		  424	    vs    664</p>
<p>Operating earnings</p>
<p> after depreciation		925	    vs  1,254</p>
<p> Pre-tax income		    642	    vs    956</p>
<p> Revenue			  10,491	    vs 10,416</p>
<p> Orders			   10,907	    vs 10,929</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG.</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
